I definitions.inc

# pull：fetch 段成功、merge 段因未提交改动失败；
# fetch 的只增对象与远程跟踪指针保留，工作目录不动
C remote
> init
<<<
+ r.txt mcur.txt
> add r.txt
<<<
> commit "remote work"
<<<

C
> init
<<<
> add-remote origin remote/.gitlet
<<<

# 制造未提交改动（staged）
+ local.txt mgiven.txt
> add local.txt
<<<

> pull origin master
You have uncommitted changes.
<<<

# fetch 段已落地：远程跟踪指针在、取回的对象可读（global-log 含 remote work 共 2 块）
E .gitlet/refs/remotes/origin/master
> global-log
${COMMIT_LOG}
${COMMIT_LOG}
<<<*

# merge 段未执行：当前分支仍只在 initial，工作目录的暂存文件原样保留
> log
===
${COMMIT_HEAD}
initial commit

<<<*
= local.txt mgiven.txt
